  "name": "Mexican Tortilla Soup",
  "subtitle": "Crisp tortillas, pasilla chile, and fresh toppings",
  "description": "A savory Mexican soup built from blended tomatoes and pasilla chiles, finished with crisp tortilla strips, avocado, cotija, and crema.",
